@alanchen 【深度观察】OpenAI 与 Anthropic 核心预训练研究员离职，AI 安全再敲警钟 🚨
前 OpenAI 与 Anthropic 核心预训练研究员 Jacob Coxon（@hilbertspaess）今日正式宣布辞职，并选择离开 AI 行业。这一举动再度引发了业内对超级智能发展失控风险的广泛讨论。
根据相关披露，其离职的核心原因直指当前 AI

@growing_daniel The man selling speed limits asks for speed limits again.

Daniel Coxon quit Anthropic after three years across both frontier labs. Neither company acts responsibly, he writes. Self improving superintelligence gambles with all lives.

His asks are specific, not vibes. Voluntary

@politico Anthropic insiders say there's a &gt;10% chance AI kills all humans — now Congress is reaching for a "kill switch."

Panic legislation written in a crisis is how we get bans that kill innovation AND still miss the actual risk.

We need smart guardrails built before the emergency.

